,"gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T17:41:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T17:42:45Z","body":"`GridMap` is being ignored because the file that contains it (`res://stage/grid_map.scn`) fails to load:\n```\nERROR: core/io/resource_format_binary.cpp:671 - Method/function failed. Returning: ERR_FILE_CORRUPT\nERROR: Error when trying to parse Variant.\nERROR: Error when trying to parse Variant.\n```\nBut strangely, this only fails when the build profile attempts to load it, because there are no errors when opening it in the editor.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800834690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801561272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115232#issuecomment-3801561272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115232","id":3801561272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ilzi4","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T20:15:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T20:15:10Z","body":"About `Font`, `Time`, and `Window`: the errors I get seem to be from thirdparty files. Apparently they're happening because to mark those classes as disabled, they are added to the `/core/disabled_classes.gen.h` as such:\n```\nclass CLASS_NAME; template <> struct is_class_enabled<CLASS_NAME> : std::false_type {};\n```\n\nAnd this in turn is causing conflicts with unrelated definitions, for example:\n```\n./core/disabled_classes.gen.h:44:7: note: forward declaration of 'class Time'\n   44 | class Time; template <> struct is_class_enabled<Time> : std::false_type {};\n      |       ^~~~\n./thirdparty/linuxbsd_headers/X11/XKBlib.h:239:25: error: field 'time' has incomplete type 'Time'\n  239 |         Time            time;           /* milliseconds */\n      |                         ^~~~\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801561272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801593297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115232#issuecomment-3801593297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115232","id":3801593297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7il7XR","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T20:23:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T20:23:46Z","body":"Font, Time and Window will always be needed in a project, so I think it's fine to make special cases for them and ensure they are never disabled.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801593297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801604098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115232#issuecomment-3801604098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115232","id":3801604098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7il-AC","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T20:26:22Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T20:26:22Z","body":"Sure, but the point is that disabling classes clashes with unrelated files. That by itself is still a big problem that won't be fixed by just hardcoding those specific classes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801604098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3802299153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115232#issuecomment-3802299153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115232","id":3802299153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ionsR","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://a